  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut\n• zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Place zucchini\n• and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven\n• tray. Drizzle generously with olive oil, season\n• with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender,\n• 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies\n• between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-b2056989.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop onion and garlic. Thinly\n• slice pear (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-3325e91d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil\n• over medium heat. Cook onion until tender,\n• 3-4 minutes. Add garlic and garlic & herb\n• seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add\n• diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, vegetable\n• stock powder, a good pinch of brown sugar, the\n• butter and a splash of water. Simmer until slightly\n• thickened, 5-6 minutes. Stir in 1/2 the mixed\n• leaves until just wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-6c6abcb3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the sauce is simmering, combine panko\n• breadcrumbs and grated Parmesan cheese in a\n• medium bowl. Drizzle with olive oil. Season, then\n• stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-4e34ced9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer roasted veggies to a baking dish. Add\n• the tomato sauce, gently stirring to combine. Top\n• evenly with shredded Cheddar cheese, followed\n• by the pangrattato. Bake until golden,\n• 8-10 minutes. Meanwhile, combine pear and\n• remaining mixed leaves in a second medium bowl.\n• Add a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil.\n• Season, then toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-5f4ecdea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy pumpkin, tomato and veggie bake\n• between plates. Serve with pear salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c566fdec0d6c07175ee4/step-d884e1ee.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
